<section class="n98c-about" aria-labelledby="n98c-about-title">
  <div class="n98c-about__wrap">
    <p class="n98c-eyebrow">About your map print</p>
    <h2 id="n98c-about-title">A map of the place <em>that matters</em></h2>
    <p class="n98c-lede">Every N°98 map is drawn from real map data, for any place on earth: a city, a village, a single street or the doorstep of your first home. You choose the colours, the shape and the words. We print it to order on heavyweight matte paper and send it to you, or straight to the person it is for.</p>

    <div class="n98c-cols">
      <div>
        <h3>How it works</h3>
        <ol class="n98c-steps">
          <li><b>Place.</b> Search an address, a street or a city and frame it just right.</li>
          <li><b>Colours.</b> Choose from more than fifty palettes made to live on a wall.</li>
          <li><b>Shape.</b> A classic rectangle, a circle or a heart.</li>
          <li><b>Text.</b> Keep the place name or add your own words and a date.</li>
          <li><b>Pins.</b> Mark the spot with a heart, a house, two rings or your initials.</li>
          <li><b>Size &amp; frame.</b> Eight sizes, unframed or framed and ready to hang.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Sizes and prices</h3>
        <ul class="n98c-sizes">
          {%- for v in product.variants -%}
            {%- if v.option2 == 'No frame' -%}
              {%- assign framed = nil -%}
              {%- for f in product.variants -%}
                {%- if f.option1 == v.option1 and f.option2 != 'No frame' and framed == nil -%}{%- assign framed = f -%}{%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
              <li><span>{{ v.option1 }}</span><span>{{ v.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% if framed %} · framed {{ framed.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}{% endif %}</span></li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
        <p class="n98c-small">All prices include VAT and free shipping within Europe, the UK and the US.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="n98c-cols">
      <div>
        <h3>Paper and frame</h3>
        <p>Premium matte paper of 200 gsm, FSC certified, with a smooth surface and no glare. The frames are solid pine in black, white, natural wood or dark wood, with shatterproof plexiglass in front and a hanging kit included. Every map arrives ready to hang.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Printed close to you</h3>
        <p>Your map is printed to order by our production partner nearest to you, so it travels a short way and arrives in good condition: usually within 3 to 7 working days in Europe and 5 to 10 in the US. If it ever arrives damaged or wrong, we send a new print.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3>Questions</h3>
    <dl class="n98c-faq">
      <dt>Can I make a map of any address?</dt>
      <dd>Yes. Any place with streets on the map works, from a world city to a small village or a single house.</dd>
      <dt>Can I send it as a gift?</dt>
      <dd>Of course. Enter the address of the person it is for at checkout and we send it straight to them.</dd>
      <dt>Which size should I choose?</dt>
      <dd>For a gift that fits any room, 30×40 or 40×50 cm. For a statement above a sofa or bed, 50×70 cm or larger. The preview shows your map on a wall, to scale, before you order.</dd>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

